  "_placeholder": false,
  "goal_text": "(Reused from sequential_022) A factory produces products X and Y. X requires 3 machine-hours and 2 labor-hours per unit (profit $20/unit). Y requires 1 machine-hour and 4 labor-hours per unit (profit $15/unit). Available per week: 180 machine-hours, 200 labor-hours. Find the quantities of X and Y that maximize weekly profit using linear programming. Show all corner points and their profits.",
